[00:18.66]You build it slips away
[00:22.16]Castles melting chalk in the rain
[00:28.14]Around you laughter without depth
[00:33.06]Faces of glass voices chasing noise
[00:38.22]They don't deserve your fire
[00:41.62]The quiet sky waits for you
[00:45.94]The quiet sky waits for you
[00:51.28]The quiet sky waits for you
[00:56.60]The quiet sky waits for you
[00:58.12]
[01:03.38]Some chase the glitter never the gold
[01:06.58]Shadows of stories already told
[01:09.18]But you are a river steady and wide
[01:12.00]Carving a path no storm can hide
[01:14.52]They call it youth but it feels like a circus
[01:16.78]Bright lights loud songs nothing with purpose
[01:19.42]Everyone running for the next distraction
[01:21.98]Fast games fast love no true reaction
[01:24.60]But you hold a fire they can't define
[01:27.08]A steady glow an ancient sign
[01:29.88]You walk through the noise your silence strong
[01:32.42]A rhythm that beats where the lost belong
[01:35.40]The quiet sky waits for you
[01:39.32]The quiet sky waits for you
[01:45.54]The quiet sky waits for you
[01:49.78]The quiet sky waits for you
[01:55.74]One day the dawn will rise unplanned
[02:01.00]A hand will find your waiting hand
[02:06.46]Not with thunder but soft and true
[02:12.60]A sunrise written only for you
[02:18.12]This moment of your life is a shifting tide
[02:22.82]
[02:25.72]Restless waves but also wide
[02:28.10]You are the horizon still becoming
[02:31.84]The quiet sky after the storm
[02:34.52]Trust your strangeness trust your depth
[02:36.82]You are not alone Not ever
[02:52.74]The quiet sky waits for you
[02:59.02]The quiet sky waits for you
